  METHOD: blind brute force over all 6 band-pair hypotheses (product bands at Rf clusters ~0.40 /
  ~0.48 / ~0.56 / ~0.58; inclusion = lower-Rf = larger amplicon), scored ONLY on cross-gel replicate
